WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Ryu blocks the opening standing light punch.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.300
Lily guards Ryu’s recorded OD Shoryuken.

3
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:02.900
Standing heavy punch punishes the reversal recovery.

4
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.400
Held OD Condor Wind continues the punish and supplies Wind stocks.

5
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.200
Standing medium kick links after the held OD Wind.

6
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.250
Wind-enhanced medium Condor Spire leads into the Super.

7
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:09.350
Breezing Hawk spends one Super stock.

8
00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:10.850
Ryu falls after the Level 1 finish.
